<translate>
==== ReplaceInPrimaryHand ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
Specifies the model that will be used to replace the main hand item with a certain animation.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
ReplaceInPrimaryHand = Bag_PistolCase_RHand holdingbagright,
</syntaxhighlight>
